Sponza Atrium 3D Model — Hero Observatory Derivative

Original model: Crytek's Sponza Atrium (Frank Meinl, August 19, 2010)
Donated to the public for radiosity testing.
Corrections by Morgan McGuire (July 14, 2011).
PBR textures by Alexandre Pestana.
Converted to glTF 2.0 by the Khronos Group glTF-Sample-Models project
using glTF-Transform.

This directory contains a modified derivative: a spatially cropped central
colonnade, reduced material dependency set, meter-scale recentering, and
high-quality texture recompression. See ATTRIBUTION.md for the exact changes.

